@page
@model WorkLedger.Pages.TestingModel

<section>
    <h1>Testing the ledger</h1>
    <p>
        <span class="hint" data-hint="xUnit tests focus on WorkItemService so CRUD logic stays reliable.">
            This suite was built with xUnit and targets `WorkItemService` to show how the service and repository respond to operations.
        </span>
        Each test spins up a fresh `InMemoryWorkItemRepository`, seeds it via `CreateItem`, and then asserts the CRUD behavior before any UI hits the handler.
    </p>
    <p>
        <span class="hint" data-hint="Use this command after making service or repository changes.">
            Use the `<code>dotnet test WorkLedger.Tests</code>` command to run the suite locally and validate any service-level changes.
        </span>
        If you build an API or persistence layer, wire new test files into this project so the home page animation can surface your flow.
    </p>
</section>
